\li{\strong{The gate of the default configuration through the executable}: 230 of 230; 17,775 mutants with SOUNDNESS 0 and COMPLETENESS 0 (agree 15,740, declined 2,034, one timeout: the first of the two mutants of section 6.1); self-test caught; hostile 1,196 rows: agree 1,124, 68 tolerated, 0 wrong accept, 0 wrong reject, 4 declined. PASS.}
